<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica money mkt shortage holds above 11 bln rand.</title>
<headline>SAfrica money mkt shortage holds above 11 bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage eased to 11.171 billion rand on Monday from 11.680 billion rand on Saturday, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
